==Battleground==
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3 seconds<sup>90f</sup>, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 28.33 seconds<sup>850f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 51.67 seconds<sup>1,550f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns as the boss.
**7 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 3~6 seconds<sup>90f~180f</sup>.
**7 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
**7 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
**4 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] will form a great combo of offense and defense in this level. Also, because there are a lot of [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]] bunched together once the base is hit, think about bringing strong [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]], such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] or [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]].

In order to beat this level, you need a constant flow of meatshields so that the Gabriels don't mow through them. If you don't have any [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel Cats]], max out your [[Worker Cat]] at the start of the game while you hold off the Gabriels, ideally with Ramen Cat. Then, spawn some of your attackers, but not the Area Attack ones just yet. Once your Cats are close to the base or about 3/4 of the way, spawn in the heavy artillery and go all out. With a bit of luck and constant meatshielding, you should win.

